# JSM Analyzer

## Overview

JSM Analyzer is a cloud-hosted operational intelligence platform built for Jira Service Management (JSM). The platform provides real-time operational analytics, historical intelligence, executive dashboards, workload analysis, queue monitoring, resolution insights, and organizational reporting.

The system was designed to support technical support teams, engineering teams, product managers, operational leadership, and executive stakeholders by transforming raw Jira operational data into actionable operational intelligence.

Unlike traditional Jira dashboards that primarily display current ticket status, JSM Analyzer introduces historical snapshot analytics, operational trend intelligence, role-based executive reporting, and persistent cloud-based operational analytics.

---

# Key Features

## Real-Time Jira Analytics

* Live Jira Service Management integration
* Automated ticket retrieval using Jira REST API
* Dynamic filtering and search
* Role-based operational dashboards
* Export to Excel functionality

---

## Executive Operational Intelligence

Provides leadership-level operational insights including:

* Queue health score
* Backlog risk detection
* Operational alerts
* High-priority ticket monitoring
* Aging ticket intelligence
* Organization-level operational bottlenecks
* Assignee workload risk analysis

---

## Historical Intelligence

Persistent historical operational analytics powered by Supabase.

Capabilities include:

* Historical snapshot storage
* Queue evolution tracking
* Backlog growth analysis
* Organization trend monitoring
* Operational trend analytics
* Longitudinal operational intelligence

---

## Role-Based Access Control

The platform supports multiple operational roles:

### Support Admin

Full operational access:

* Load/refresh Jira data
* Export operational data
* Access all dashboards
* Administrative controls

### Engineer / Product Manager

Operational analytics access with limited administrative privileges.

### SLT Viewer

Executive-level access with strategic operational dashboards and restricted operational controls.

---

## Authentication System

* Secure login system
* Password hashing using bcrypt
* Session persistence
* Protected dashboards
* Role-based authorization

