# System Architecture

## High-Level Architecture

```text
Jira Service Management
           ↓
      Jira REST API
           ↓
     Streamlit Cloud App
           ↓
     Supabase PostgreSQL
           ↓
 Historical Intelligence
           ↓
 Executive Dashboards
```

